The purpose of the ME model is actually quite simple

5
00:00:10,499 --> 00:00:12,779
it aims to use the same computational resources

6
00:00:12,779 --> 00:00:15,710
to train a much larger model, uh

7
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:17,610
First of all, the MOE model

8
00:00:17,610 --> 00:00:19,470
translated into Chinese as the mixture of experts model

9
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:21,990
Want to know why we need to train a mixture of experts model?

